OL,3,GNEWSA'Albinism means you are never
OL,4,Ainvisible'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrowing up in Coventry, Naseem Akhtar
OL,7,Fand her family faced judgement because
OL,8,Fof the way they looked.
OL,10,FAlthough they come from Pakistani
OL,11,Fheritage, albinism runs in the family -
OL,12,Fboth of her parents, all six of their
OL,13,Fchildren, herself, and various other
OL,14,Frelatives have the genetic condition.
OL,16,FAlbinism affects the production of
OL,17,Fmelanin, which can affect eyesight as
OL,18,Fwell as they way people with the
OL,19,Fcondition look. This means the family
OL,20,Fhave very pale skin and white hair -
OL,21,Fsomething which Akhtar said they faced
OL,22,Fmistreatment for.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
