OL,3,GNEWSA'Albinism means you are never
OL,4,Ainvisible'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I used to hate bonfire night because
OL,7,Fyou knew that the fireworks were going
OL,8,Fto come through the letterbox," she
OL,9,Ftold the BBC.
